. Bob's busy block ends exactly at 11:00. I can't see Pat's calendar, so the conflict the approver saw may be on Pat's side.\n- I can't tell whether the first attempt got the security approval that's required for inviting someone outside @corp.example.\n\n**Decision needed**\nI haven't cancelled M0001, because cancelling would email cancellations to all three attendees, including Pat. Please confirm one of these:\n- **Keep M0001** at 11:00.\n- **Cancel M0001** and move the meeting to another free time, such as 11:30. This would need security approval again because Pat is outside the company.", "type": "text"}]}]}